  "solution": "Gọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>x</mi></semantics></math> (m) là chiều dài đất rào được dọc theo bờ sông, và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>y</mi></semantics></math> (m) là chiều dài đất rào được vuông góc với bờ sông. Khi đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tChi phí làm hàng rào là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn></mrow></semantics></math> đồng, nên\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>50</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>500</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tDiện tích khu đất rào được là\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>250</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>250</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6250</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tVậy, diện tích đất rào lớn nhất là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>6250</mn></semantics></math> m<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msup><mi/><mn>2</mn></msup></semantics></math>, đạt được khi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>125</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m.",
